      "license": "AGPL-3.0-only",
      "testOnly": true,
      "rationale": "An independent Python implementation of all thirteen bitmap document mutations, authored from the snapshot and payload schemas. It replays fourteen committed before/mutation/diff/outcome/after vectors, computes its own inverse and checks declared mutation lanes. PinSolution validates the complete row-major output, and RestorePins preserves the exact prior sequence. The solver remains an independent inference capability; document mutation semantics are validated here.",
